{"page":254,"verses":[{"verse_key":"13:35","surah":13,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"۞ مَّثَلُ ٱلْجَنَّةِ ٱلَّتِى وُعِدَ ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ ۖ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ أُكُلُهَا دَآئِمٌ وَظِلُّهَا ۚ تِلْكَ عُقْبَى ٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّقَوا۟ ۖ وَّعُقْبَى ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ ٱلنَّارُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Here is a picture of the Garden that those mindful of God have been promised: flowing streams and perpetual food and shade. This is the reward that awaits those who are mindful of God; the disbelievers’ reward is the Fire.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ مَّثَلُ","en_gloss":"The example","transliteration":"mathalu","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","en_gloss":"of Paradise","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وُعِدَ","en_gloss":"(is) promised","transliteration":"wuʿida","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(to) the righteous","transliteration":"l-mutaqūna","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"flows","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَحْتِهَا","en_gloss":"underneath it","transliteration":"taḥtihā","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ","en_gloss":"the rivers","transliteration":"l-anhāru","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أُكُلُهَا","en_gloss":"Its food","transliteration":"ukuluhā","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"دَآئِمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) everlasting","transliteration":"dāimun","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَظِلُّهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"and its shade","transliteration":"waẓilluhā","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تِلْكَ","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"til'ka","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عُقْبَى","en_gloss":"(is the) end","transliteration":"ʿuq'bā","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"of those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱتَّقَوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"(are) righteous","transliteration":"ittaqaw","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَّعُقْبَى","en_gloss":"and (the) end","transliteration":"waʿuq'bā","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلنَّارُ","en_gloss":"(is) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāru","verse_key":"13:35"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:35"}]},{"verse_key":"13:36","surah":13,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ يَفْرَحُونَ بِمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْكَ ۖ وَمِنَ ٱلْأَحْزَابِ مَن يُنكِرُ بَعْضَهُۥ ۚ قُلْ إِنَّمَآ أُمِرْتُ أَنْ أَعْبُدَ ٱللَّهَ وَلَآ أُشْرِكَ بِهِۦٓ ۚ إِلَيْهِ أَدْعُوا۟ وَإِلَيْهِ مَـَٔابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those to whom We sent the Scripture rejoice in what has been revealed to you [Prophet]; some factions deny parts of it. Say, ‘I am commanded to worship God, and not join anything with Him in worship: to Him I call [others] and to Him I shall return.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those (to) whom","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"We have given them","transliteration":"ātaynāhumu","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَفْرَحُونَ","en_gloss":"rejoice","transliteration":"yafraḥūna","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"at what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"has been revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"but among","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَحْزَابِ","en_gloss":"the groups","transliteration":"l-aḥzābi","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(those) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُنكِرُ","en_gloss":"deny","transliteration":"yunkiru","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَعْضَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"a part of it","transliteration":"baʿḍahu","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أُمِرْتُ","en_gloss":"I have been commanded","transliteration":"umir'tu","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَعْبُدَ","en_gloss":"I worship","transliteration":"aʿbuda","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أُشْرِكَ","en_gloss":"I associate partners","transliteration":"ush'rika","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":21,"ar":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"with Him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":22,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"To Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَدْعُوا۟","en_gloss":"I call","transliteration":"adʿū","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَإِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"and to Him","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":25,"ar":"مَـَٔابِ","en_gloss":"(is) my return","transliteration":"maābi","verse_key":"13:36"},{"pos":26,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:36"}]},{"verse_key":"13:37","surah":13,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ حُكْمًا عَرَبِيًّا ۚ وَلَئِنِ ٱتَّبَعْتَ أَهْوَآءَهُم بَعْدَ مَا جَآءَكَ مِنَ ٱلْعِلْمِ مَا لَكَ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ مِن وَلِىٍّ وَلَا وَاقٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So We have sent down the Quran to give judgement in the Arabic language. If you were to follow their desires, after the knowledge that has come to you, you would have no one to guard you or protect you from God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We have revealed it","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حُكْمًا","en_gloss":"(to be) a judgment of authority","transliteration":"ḥuk'man","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَرَبِيًّۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) Arabic","transliteration":"ʿarabiyyan","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَئِنِ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-ini","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱتَّبَعْتَ","en_gloss":"you follow","transliteration":"ittabaʿta","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَهْوَآءَهُم","en_gloss":"their desires","transliteration":"ahwāahum","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَعْدَ مَا","en_gloss":"after what","transliteration":"baʿdamā","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَآءَكَ","en_gloss":"came to you","transliteration":"jāaka","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعِلْمِ","en_gloss":"the knowledge","transliteration":"l-ʿil'mi","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَلِىٍّۢ","en_gloss":"protector","transliteration":"waliyyin","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَاقٍۢ","en_gloss":"defender","transliteration":"wāqin","verse_key":"13:37"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:37"}]},{"verse_key":"13:38","surah":13,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَرْسَلْنَا رُسُلًا مِّن قَبْلِكَ وَجَعَلْنَا لَهُمْ أَزْوَٰجًا وَذُرِّيَّةً ۚ وَمَا كَانَ لِرَسُولٍ أَن يَأْتِىَ بِـَٔايَةٍ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ ۗ لِكُلِّ أَجَلٍ كِتَابٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent messengers before you and gave them wives and offspring; no messenger was given the power to produce a miracle except with God’s permission. There was a Scripture for every age:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رُسُلًۭا","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"rusulan","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"and We made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","en_gloss":"wives","transliteration":"azwājan","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَذُرِّيَّةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"and offspring","transliteration":"wadhurriyyatan","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِرَسُولٍ","en_gloss":"for a Messenger","transliteration":"lirasūlin","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَأْتِىَ","en_gloss":"he comes","transliteration":"yatiya","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِـَٔايَةٍ","en_gloss":"with a sign","transliteration":"biāyatin","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِإِذْنِ","en_gloss":"by the leave","transliteration":"bi-idh'ni","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"For everything","transliteration":"likulli","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَجَلٍۢ","en_gloss":"(is) a time","transliteration":"ajalin","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":21,"ar":"كِتَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"prescribed","transliteration":"kitābun","verse_key":"13:38"},{"pos":22,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:38"}]},{"verse_key":"13:39","surah":13,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"يَمْحُوا۟ ٱللَّهُ مَا يَشَآءُ وَيُثْبِتُ ۖ وَعِندَهُۥٓ أُمُّ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God erases or confirms whatever He will, and the source of Scripture is with Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَمْحُوا۟","en_gloss":"(Is) eliminated","transliteration":"yamḥū","verse_key":"13:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"13:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"13:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"13:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيُثْبِتُ ۖ","en_gloss":"and confirms","transliteration":"wayuth'bitu","verse_key":"13:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعِندَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"and with Him","transliteration":"waʿindahu","verse_key":"13:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُمُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the Mother (of) the Book","transliteration":"ummu","verse_key":"13:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(is) the Mother (of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"13:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:39"}]},{"verse_key":"13:40","surah":13,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن مَّا نُرِيَنَّكَ بَعْضَ ٱلَّذِى نَعِدُهُمْ أَوْ نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ فَإِنَّمَا عَلَيْكَ ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ وَعَلَيْنَا ٱلْحِسَابُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whether We let you [Prophet] see part of what We threaten them with, or cause you to die [before that], your duty is only to deliver the message: the Reckoning is Ours.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And whether","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"(what)","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نُرِيَنَّكَ","en_gloss":"We show you","transliteration":"nuriyannaka","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَعْضَ","en_gloss":"a part","transliteration":"baʿḍa","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَعِدُهُمْ","en_gloss":"We have promised them","transliteration":"naʿiduhum","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ","en_gloss":"We cause you to die","transliteration":"natawaffayannaka","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَإِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"so only","transliteration":"fa-innamā","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"on you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","en_gloss":"(is) the conveyance","transliteration":"l-balāghu","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَعَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"and on Us","transliteration":"waʿalaynā","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْحِسَابُ","en_gloss":"(is) the reckoning","transliteration":"l-ḥisābu","verse_key":"13:40"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤٠","en_gloss":"(40)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:40"}]},{"verse_key":"13:41","surah":13,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّا نَأْتِى ٱلْأَرْضَ نَنقُصُهَا مِنْ أَطْرَافِهَا ۚ وَٱللَّهُ يَحْكُمُ لَا مُعَقِّبَ لِحُكْمِهِۦ ۚ وَهُوَ سَرِيعُ ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not see how We come to [their] land and shrink its borders? God decides- no one can reverse His decision- and He is swift in reckoning.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Did not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yaraw","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّا","en_gloss":"that We","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَأْتِى","en_gloss":"come","transliteration":"natī","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"(to) the land","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَنقُصُهَا","en_gloss":"reducing it","transliteration":"nanquṣuhā","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَطْرَافِهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"its borders","transliteration":"aṭrāfihā","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَحْكُمُ","en_gloss":"judges","transliteration":"yaḥkumu","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُعَقِّبَ","en_gloss":"adjuster","transliteration":"muʿaqqiba","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِحُكْمِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) His Judgment","transliteration":"liḥuk'mihi","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":15,"ar":"سَرِيعُ","en_gloss":"(is) Swift","transliteration":"sarīʿu","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_gloss":"(in) the reckoning","transliteration":"l-ḥisābi","verse_key":"13:41"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٤١","en_gloss":"(41)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:41"}]},{"verse_key":"13:42","surah":13,"ayah":42,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَدْ مَكَرَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ فَلِلَّهِ ٱلْمَكْرُ جَمِيعًا ۖ يَعْلَمُ مَا تَكْسِبُ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ۗ وَسَيَعْلَمُ ٱلْكُفَّـٰرُ لِمَنْ عُقْبَى ٱلدَّارِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those before them also schemed, but the overall scheme belongs to God: He knows what each soul does. In the end, the disbelievers will find out who will h